# GSAP

## Owns

Pins, camera pushes, text/image reveals, horizontal chapters, timeline sync, counters, video scrub (when used), character transitions.

## Rules

- Only inside client animation islands — never Server Components
- Wrap with `gsap.context()`; kill on unmount / route change
- Prefer `transform` / `opacity`; avoid layout thrash
- Sync with Lenis via `scrollerProxy` when Lenis is active
- Budget: **one major pin sequence** on home unless justified
- No GSAP for trivial button hover (use CSS)

## Anti-patterns

```tsx
// ❌ Timeline in a Server section file
// ❌ Stacking Framer + GSAP on opacity
// ❌ Leaving ScrollTriggers after navigate
```
